-- Owns a variant type referenced by a sibling under its UNQUALIFIED name.
-- Named to sort AFTER its user (`Alpha`) so the discovery order alone would
-- check the user first — the exact arrangement that leaked an unresolved
-- placeholder ("I cannot find `Beast`") before module dependency ordering
-- learned to follow unqualified type/constructor references.
mod Zoo do
  type Beast
    = Lion
    | Tiger(Int)
end
